---

## End-to-End Workflow

### Recommended Steps

```bash
# Step 1: Set up configuration
# Review and customize config/simulator_config.yaml

# Step 2: Generate synthetic data
python src/main.py --mode simulate

# Step 3: Engineer features
python src/main.py --mode features

